atthew Modabber已被解雇\n\n据《纽约邮报》，Polymarket已解雇首席营销官Matthew Modabber。他自2024年1月起任职，是 28 岁的 CEO Coplan 的亲信.\n\n知情人士称，解雇源于公司今年早些时候启动的内部调查，起因是一系列负面事件。 https://t.co/EA7hP28EX5","url":"https://x.com/PANewsCN/status/2113440555296489891"},{"author_id":"1260553941714186241","created_at":"2026-10-23T01:20:00.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113440267491569862"],"id":"2113440267491569862","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":154,"impression_count":109336,"like_count":890,"quote_count":8,"reply_count":94,"retweet_count":93},"text":"华为问界车主称行驶中起火被归因“香薰瓶折射阳光”，弹幕：“恶意起火”“玄武喷火”\n\n10月22日，一名四川问界车主在抖音发布视频称，今年5月，其车辆在行驶中无碰撞起火，火从副驾中控台位置往外喷射。\n其称，检测报告称起火是“香薰瓶折射阳光”造成的。\n车主写道：“我又能说什么呢？？”\n\n网友留言： https://t.co/Dar1AKByig https://t.co/mn3BQmRmwp","url":"https://x.com/whyyoutouzhele/status/2113440267491569862"},{"author_id":"1154174763918606339","created_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:48.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113439968534130740"],"id":"2113439968534130740","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":1,"impression_count":5576,"like_count":7,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":0},"text":"‼️重要新闻‼️重要信号📶‼️\n\n八位中国顶级富豪，名下1400亿美元财产或将被征税。\n\n此前不少国内企业家通过国内创业、海外上市的方式，将财富留在境外，如今这条避税路径已走不通。","url":"https://x.com/maoshen/status/2113439968534130740"},{"author_id":"39941478","created_at":"2026-10-23T01:18:45.000Z","edit_history_tweet_ids":["2113439954869035039"],"id":"2113439954869035039","lang":"zh","public_metrics":{"bookmark_count":3,"impression_count":24594,"like_count":12,"quote_count":0,"reply_count":5,"retweet_count":1},"text":"新加坡政府科技局展开工作队伍转型计划的第二阶段，有38人被裁退，另有106人可接受再培训后转换工作岗位。 https://t.co/JBSLWrRtxU","url":"https://x.com/zaobaosg/status/2113439954869035039"}],"includes":{"users":[{"id":"791197","name":"BBC News 中文","username":"bbcchinese"},{"id":"46574977","name":"华尔街日报中文网","username":"ChineseWSJ"},{"id":"1260553941714186241","name":"李老师不是你老师","username":"whyyoutouzhele"},{"id":"8149482","name":"美国之音中文网","username":"VOAChinese"},{"id":"825183199198212096","name":"BITWU.ETH